        <body>
            <div xml:id="d761-a4">

                <pb facs="0720" n="622" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg622"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Subinclosure 3.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Press Censor to Mr.
                            Hollis</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Pretoria</hi>, 124</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-02-01"><hi rendition="#italic">February 1,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Please say if prisoners are allowed to receive parcels tobacco; other things. Are
                    they allowed newspapers?</p>
            </div>
        </body>
